  	<string name="wireless_adb_address">Address</string>
  	<string name="wireless_adb_warning">This is a risk, and it is marked as one. Anything that can reach this phone on the tailnet, and that has your adb key, has the phone: it can read everything on it and change anything on it. The port stays open until you turn this off. Turn it off when you do not need it.</string>
  	<string name="wireless_adb_confirm">This opens port 5555 on the phone\'s tailnet, so that adb can reach it without a cable.\n\nAnything on your tailnet with your adb key can then control the phone completely. The port stays open until you turn this off.\n\nTurn it on?</string>
